{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3 by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad61ccc6f0d555c95a6fc8064a7d2d8d724ab9f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2021}{2020} - \\frac{2020}{2021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" /> is equal to the fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7347a1d5586e82c832f61ea799d89945ed2837fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p}{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"11\" height=\"36\" /> in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers whose greatest common divisor is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe43c131d06cbf34ba75232b197018a749834343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${ }1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/4/6f438b7a0799025eeabc7df166021f74333e7611.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/b/d6b53819f23c3f50c1bb66c5e116afff60844d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textbf{A})\\: 1\\qquad(\\textbf{B}) \\: 9\\qquad(\\textbf{C}) \\: 2020\\qquad(\\textbf{D}) \\: 2021\\qquad(\\textbf{E}) \\: 4041$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"422\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We write the given expression as a single fraction: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2a8b57c3444b4d6d105cf4b1bb576bc94c0724.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2021}{2020} - \\frac{2020}{2021} = \\frac{2021\\cdot2021-2020\\cdot2020}{2020\\cdot2021}\\]\" width=\"321\" height=\"37\" /> by cross multiplication. Then by factoring the numerator, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc055fe35682fe8e51fe5e3752c645442fb00ed0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2021\\cdot2021-2020\\cdot2020}{2020\\cdot2021}=\\frac{(2021-2020)(2021+2020)}{2020\\cdot2021}.\\]\" width=\"446\" height=\"38\" /> The question is asking for the numerator, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313ad38aec311ac8bae0a6a9d6b6226d8c77187b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2021+2020=4041,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/61347e215e0ae1b4629ef2e984ce2252de848add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }4041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"83\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\" title=\"User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\">Aops-g5-gethsemanea2</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7afc587638a9f7af62f01aae01f4545b413c1f34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Hence,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b76d9ba7d137b1ffb405d95f4b7a4b5d37ace2e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{2021}{2020} - \\frac{2020}{2021} &amp; = \\frac{a + 1}{a} - \\frac{a}{a + 1} \\\\ &amp; = \\frac{\\left( a + 1 \\right)^2 - a^2}{a \\left( a + 1 \\right)} \\\\ &amp; = \\frac{2 a + 1}{a \\left( a + 1 \\right)} . \\end{align*}\" width=\"235\" height=\"139\" />\n</p><p>We observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/5671b57c88804ee363ba4eefe440baf45939ae55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm gcd} \\left( 2a + 1 , a \\right) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e42c8e2d26af5c10cf13954a73bf7c9b79c85ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm gcd} \\left( 2a + 1 , a + 1 \\right) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fdefd2519591e1eb17a1e831a3990c6eec09a434.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${\\rm gcd} \\left( 2a + 1 , a \\left( a + 1 \\right) \\right) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/3617e1b8576cac51df022feb0eb05ca198b8b1fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 2 a + 1 = 4041$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/61347e215e0ae1b4629ef2e984ce2252de848add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }4041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"83\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Turning term 1 to a fraction:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/995a1898d10f57226f9dd9a5ededdedd3bf1d9b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2021}{2020}-\\frac{2020}{2021}=1+\\frac{1}{2020}-\\frac{2020}{2021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"263\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the last term from the first term gives us:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2bc0098b01c5e0dbabc9ce2d977665d7ca7bb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2021}+\\frac{1}{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Doing some simple cross multiplication, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdf5511efea86274ab12997ea4fbacf2ffca97bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4041}{2020\\cdot2021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />, here you can see the numerator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967869635b9bc3e54fd6676e57d82fc085cc5cae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}4041}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~RandomMathGuy500\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=160\">https://youtu.be/p9_RH4s-kBA?t=160</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ludy6AnQkrI\">https://youtu.be/ludy6AnQkrI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution 2 by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PPIZH_iBTJw\">https://youtu.be/PPIZH_iBTJw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution 3 by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3 by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lC7naDZ1Eu4?t=378\">https://youtu.be/lC7naDZ1Eu4?t=378</a>\n~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-a